          "execution_status": "SUCCESS",
          "provider": "gemini",
          "rank": 1,
          "reason": "Cintas reported record Q1 fiscal 2027 results on September 23, surpassing $3 billion in quarterly revenue for the first time. Management raised full-year revenue and EPS guidance, citing 8.9% organic growth and record gross margins. The strong performance, combined with an aggressive $545 million share buyback and 15.6% dividend hike, provides powerful fundamental momentum.",
