          "reason": "Q1 FY2027 earnings Sept 23 beat with $3.01B revenue (+10.9% YoY) and $1.39 EPS vs $1.35 estimates. Record quarter with margin expansion, but stock already moved 3% post-earnings, reducing near-term upside for 2-5 day horizon.",
          "risk": "Earnings catalyst is 2 days old with initial 3% pop already realized; limited additional catalysts for follow-through in short timeframe compared to fresher opportunities.",
